            "notes": "**Threads of Fate** is always my first Power, no matter what. It beats out every single other one without fail for first slot, it simply provides that much extra value in my experience.\n\n---\n\nFirst round, you're only going to have enough for the basic WP/AS perks, so go ahead and grab a Survival perk just to round off your Cash. My personal preference is **First Aid Kit**, because it's more well rounded, and doesn't rely on the map or you being on point. Another good option is **Electrolytes**, especially if the enemy team are made of flanking types who may hover around spawn, like a Genji or Reaper.",
