            "notes": "**Supply Surge** is my new favourite secondary go-to Power. None of the others really come close to it, especially when taken after **Threads of Fate**. And before you ask, **yes, it works on BOTH beam targets!!** Having that kind of utility/value on multiple people is super helpful. It also works on ALL allies you have your beams attached to when you ult, AND you can use it twice during ult if you time your cooldowns well enough.\n\n---\n\nHere's where you're going to need to start shuffling things around depending on your Cash amount.\n\nAgain, just try to keep those two stats roughly even. They don't have to be perfect, but the closer they are, the better.",
