            "notes": "Here is where you should start making sure to keep an eye on the description/effect of the perks as well. They can often give added Weapon Power or Attack Speed that isn't shown on her stats, which you'll want to try and account for.\n\nFor example, it shows that she only has 10 AS vs her 40 WP, but this is because of the **Battle Medic** power. It gives a stacking buff to Attack Speed, giving an extra 30% after 10 seconds of holding your beam on someone. This buff doesn't decay, so if you're not a Barbie Blaster user, you'll have that up almost constantly, meaning it's a good idea to try and keep your Weapon Power higher to even it out.",
